---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — Clicker"
  description="Clicker’s privacy policy: the app collects nothing; this site collects only the email you choose to leave for a beta invite."
>
  <article class="container prose">
    <p class="ecp">privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: November 14, 2026</p>

    <h2>The app</h2>
    <p>
      Clicker collects nothing. To control your TV, the app talks directly
      to your Roku over your local Wi-Fi network. There are no accounts, no
      analytics, no trackers, no ads, and no servers of ours involved —
      commands go from your phone to your Roku.
    </p>

    <h2>Purchases</h2>
    <p>
      Plans are bought through Apple’s App Store. Apple takes the payment
      and tells the app only whether a plan is active. We never see your
      name, your card, or your Apple ID, and Apple’s own privacy policy
      covers what it does with that information.
    </p>

    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>
      This site sets no cookies and runs no analytics or trackers. It collects
      exactly one thing, and only if you choose to give it: the email address
      you enter in the beta form.
    </p>
    <p>
      That address is submitted through
      <a href="https://formspree.io" rel="noopener">Formspree</a>, a
      third-party form service, and delivered to our inbox. We use it solely
      to send you a TestFlight beta invite. We never sell it, share it, or add
      it to a mailing list, and we’ll delete it on request.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <!-- TODO(domain): publish a contact address once the new domain and
           its email exist. -->
      A contact address will be published here when the site goes live.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 680px;
    padding-block: calc(var(--space) * 10);
  }

  .prose h1 { margin-top: calc(var(--space) * 3); }

  .prose .updated {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-top: var(--space);
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-top: calc(var(--space) * 5);
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--space) * 1.5);
  }

  .prose p + p { margin-top: calc(var(--space) * 2); }
</style>
